    414 "Rolling back"
    415 "pending"
    416 "running"
    417 "done"
    418 "failed"
    419 "Removing..."

    // ---------- 结果页 ----------
    500 "Result"
    501 "Installation complete"
    502 "Installation failed"
    503 "Cancelled"
    504 "Launch application"
    505 "Open log"
    506 "Copy details"
    507 "Log"
    508 "The application was installed for the current user. Nothing else was changed."
    509 "Nothing was installed. Any temporary state created by this run was cleaned up."
    510 "The administrator prompt was declined, so nothing was changed. You can try again."
    511 "The application could not be launched. It may have no start menu entry, or the launch was blocked by policy."
    512 "This publisher is not in the pinned allow list. An administrator can add its SHA-256 fingerprint to HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\MsixpkgInstaller\\AllowedPublishers, or run the installer again and choose to trust it."
    513 "The publisher certificate is not trusted. Check that the certificate is still valid and that the package was signed with the same certificate."
    514 "The package signature could not be validated. The file may be corrupted or tampered with; obtain it again from the original source."
    515 "The application is in use. Close it (and any of its windows) and try again."
    516 "A higher version is already installed. Remove it first, or run the installer with the downgrade option."
    517 "The operation needs administrator rights. Approval was refused or the account cannot elevate."
    518 "A dependency (framework) package could not be installed. Install the required framework package and try again."
    519 "The package is not valid for this computer. Check the package architecture and the minimum Windows version."
    520 "The container failed validation. Re-download the file from its original source and try again."
    521 "The file could not be read or written. Check that the path exists and that the disk is not full."
    522 "The package architecture does not match this computer."
    523 "See the log for the exact failure code and the steps that were taken."
    524 "Provisioning for all users requires administrator rights and a system-volume copy of the package."

    // ---------- 管理页 ----------
    600 "Manage installations"
    601 "Packages installed by this installer"
    602 "Only packages recorded by this installer are listed."
    603 "Name"
    604 "Version"
