    616 "Select an installation in the list first."
    617 "Uninstall the selected package? The publisher certificate is only removed when nothing else needs it."
    618 "Nothing to suggest: the state store matches the system."
    619 "Repair only reports; it never changes anything by itself."
    620 "Details"

